{"title":"I’m Really Not The Demon God’s Lackey","synopsis":"Lin Jie seorang transmigran adalah pemilik toko buku di dunia lain Dia baik dan berhati hangat sering merekomendasikan buku penyembuhan kepada pelanggan yang mengalami masa sulit Dari waktu ke waktu dia diamdiam mempromosikan karyanya sendiri juga\nSeiring waktu pelanggan ini mulai sangat menghormatinya beberapa bahkan sering membawa makanan khas lokal untuk membalas budi Mereka sering mencari pendapat profesionalnya dalam memilih buku dan berbagi pengalaman dengan pemilik toko buku biasa ini kepada orangorang di sekitar mereka\nMereka dengan hormat dan akrab menyebut dia dengan menggunakan namanama seperti Pesuruh Dewa Setan Penyebar Injil Daging dan Darah Penulis Ritus dan Pabean Sekte Pemakan Mayat dan Gembala Bintang","alternative_title":"Updating","author":"","artist":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy","Supranatural"],"chapters":[{"id":"813de7b8-f159-4d70-808f-3eaecb121919","number":"194","title":"Chapter 194","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"92e64529-39e6-4e41-a53c-4ca525f12c96","number":"193","title":"Chapter 193","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"5e203a62-e8ca-4837-a1c7-8fbd92df2e33","number":"192","title":"Chapter 192","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"79b5d66f-8c88-4fab-b0ee-ed3afb690cc4","number":"191","title":"Chapter 191","date":"2026-07-08","images":[]},{"id":"dd0d1954-8291-4874-8e54-94d70f5e23ca","number":"190","title":"Chapter 190","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"id":"d19dbaea-be0c-40db-afb8-cc94ce182cd3","number":"189","title":"Chapter 189","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"id":"f8c1d7d0-ebce-4ff4-8b86-92c59f63a262","number":"188","title":"Chapter 188","date":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"id":"3997d795-b9c3-4470-8a7d-001841d35834","number":"187","title":"Chapter 187","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"id":"a770ef1e-0529-4e50-b181-9fa63ff4d7cd","number":"186","title":"Chapter 186","date":"2026-06-03","images":[]},{"id":"2c8fe4d0-e8b1-4987-a059-09740243